flowchart TD
    Public[Separate public profile on port 8003] --> API[FastAPI in the chosen local profile]
    Private[Private profile on port 8000] --> API
    UI[React workspace with 14 areas] --> API
    API --> Access[Current user, role and project checks]
    Access --> Documents[Private documents and field review]
    Documents --> Sources[Human-confirmed source records]
    Access --> Prices[Materials, searches and reviewed quotations]
    Access --> Takeoff[Drawings, quantities and checked sheets]
    Prices --> Estimates[Versioned estimates and independent budget approval]
    Takeoff --> Estimates
    Access --> Commercial[Contracts, awards, certificates and amendments]
    Sources --> Commercial
    Commercial --> Accounting[Accepted cost, journals, payables and receivables]
    Accounting --> Forecast[Shared forecasts and performance reports]
    Estimates --> Forecast
    Access --> Workflow[Saved document and financial check steps]
    Sources --> Workflow
    Workflow --> Proposal[Exact payment proposal and reservations]
    Forecast --> CashGate[Current cash and required 30-day reserve checks]
    Proposal --> CashGate
    CashGate --> Human[Different authorized person approves]
    Human --> Recheck[Current authority, sources, cash and expiry]
    Recheck --> Settlement[Atomic sandbox payment, ledger, receipt and audit]
    Access --> Reviews[Role-aware review inbox and team controls]
    Access --> Jobs[Saved jobs, leases and bounded recovery]
    Jobs --> Workflow
    Jobs --> Prices
    Workflow -. explanation only .-> Model[Built-in explanation or optional local model]
    Settlement --> Storage[(The chosen profile's SQLite database and private files)]
    Accounting --> Storage
    Sources --> Storage
    Estimates --> Storage
    Reviews --> Storage
    Storage --> Audit[Local hash-chain verification and evidence]
